# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion programme's four-card window, WP6's own jobs (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/fusion-1 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. WP6/ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is the placeholder for the tag the pack's B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). The cards are
# under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# WO1 (PROFILE): the device profile of the combined arm at EIGHT USERS, the P1 conventions of the earlier packs: status, an all-four reset and two gate arms on the SAME
# eight real-text coding prompts (8 x 4,096 tokens; user 0 asks 256 tokens out, the others 128, all ignore_eos): ops-twin unprofiled (the per-round trace_ms, the
# [PACKED-*] and [PHASE] splits and the texts), ops-trace profiled (tracy, op-support 20000 - 200000 segfaults the dispatch thread, any other count is refused - the CPP
# post-process only). NEVER CANCEL this job once the gate step has started: the profiler writes as root and a cancel can leave root-owned files that break the next
# checkout. Disk: the profile tree up to 4 GB. READ: ops-trace texts equal ops-twin's; then, per quad site against the v678 control (scratchpad prof678 / quaddiff.txt):
# the gather-add glue rows (4 slices, 3 adds: 80 launches a quad become 10 on the reduce chains), the swiglu_device row (45 launches -> 5), the residual rows (40 -> 10),
# the gate + up matmul rows (10 -> 5 at twice the per-core columns), and the gate/up, down and conv-projection matmul times on the (13, k) grids (v678: 88.1 us for gate
# and up, 91.4 for down on the (8, 10) grids). Say AVAILABLE WORKER CORE COUNT. Duration (estimate): 150 minutes (100 best, 210 worst). Soft.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-wp6
C2_GATE_PLAN=ops-twin,ops-trace
C2_GATE_JIT=record
